      "text": "Lagos issues traffic advisory ahead of Eyo Festival\n\nThe Lagos State Government has issued a traffic advisory ahead of the Eyo Festival, cautioning motorists and commuters to expect road closures and heavy traffic around Lagos Island.\n\nIn a statement shared via its official Instagram handle, lagosstategovt, the government said the cultural festival, which celebrates Lagos’ rich heritage, is expected to significantly affect vehicular movement within and around the Island.\n---\nContinue reading in the comment section",
